flowchart TB
  accTitle: Marketplace discovery, installation, and activation
  accDescr: Source registries and repositories supply packages. The website browses them. Local installation validates and previews changes, performs a file transaction, then activates code or projects agent assets through Harness Sync.
  repo["Marketplace sources<br/>Dork Labs + third-party repositories"]
  site["Website marketplace<br/>Discovery + README pages"]
  user["DorkOS client / CLI / MCP caller"]
  installer["Local MarketplaceInstaller<br/>Resolve → fetch/cache → validate → preview"]
  txn["File transaction<br/>Stage → backup → rename → restore on failure"]
  disk[("Installed packages<br/>User / project / agent scope")]
  activate["Activation by package type<br/>Extensions · messaging · agents · shapes"]
  harness["Harness Sync<br/>Project skills, commands, hooks and MCP config"]
  runtime["Harness-native files<br/>Read by Claude Code / Codex / OpenCode"]
  telemetry["Website telemetry endpoint<br/>Install reporting, not package delivery"]
  repo -->|"HTTPS registry / sidecar / README"| site
  repo -->|"HTTPS / Git / npm / local source"| installer
  user -->|"HTTP API or MCP tool"| installer
  installer -->|"Authorized install"| txn
  txn --> disk
  disk --> activate
  disk --> harness
  harness --> runtime
  installer -->|"Install outcome, subject to telemetry settings"| telemetry
